        "original_id": "1c7f5383-ff46-5e63-b204-02ce6c82f824",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Taylor Swift, Shellback, Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, Zaeden, Krishna Kedia, Justin Bieber\n- Albums and songs: 1989, Red, Animals, Magic, Don't Wanna Know, Love Yourself\n- Roles: songwriter, record producer, musician, singer\n\nFacts:\n- Taylor Swift began composing the album \"1989\" after releasing her previous studio album \"Red\" in 2012.\n- Shellback, born Karl Johan Schuster on 1 February 1985, is a Swedish songwriter, record producer, and musician.\n- The Maroon 5 song \"Animals\" was written by Adam Levine, Benny Blanco, and Shellback, and Shellback also produced it.\n- Zaeden is best known for his remixes of Coldplay's \"Magic\", Maroon 5's \"Animals\" and \"Don't Wanna Know\", and Justin Bieber's \"Love Yourself\".\n- Zaeden is the brother of singer Krishna Kedia.",
